        "original_id": "a10a96f6-86b5-5690-9416-b8bab7cdcadc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Nickelodeon Studios, Nickelodeon on Sunset, Earl Carroll Theatre, Hollywood, Orlando, Florida, California, Sunset Boulevard\n- Products: Kenan & Kel, All That\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n\nFacts:\n- The first two seasons of Kenan & Kel were filmed at Nickelodeon Studios in Orlando, Florida.\n- The remaining two seasons of Kenan & Kel were filmed at Nickelodeon on Sunset in Hollywood.\n- Nickelodeon on Sunset was formerly known as the Earl Carroll Theatre.\n- Nickelodeon on Sunset was a stage facility located at 6230 Sunset Boulevard in Hollywood, California.\n- Since 1997, Nickelodeon on Sunset has housed West Coast productions of live-action original series for the Nickelodeon cable channel.\n- In 1997, production of the third season of All That began at Nickelodeon on Sunset.",
